Description: Match the symlink helper definition to its existing call-site guard
 The MinGW target has no POSIX symlink function. Its call site already uses
 S_IFLNK, but the unconditional unused helper still fails modern GCC checks.
 The same condition leaves Unix behavior unchanged.
